          "value": "<p>The ravens' angry pecking deals [[/r 1d8[piercing]]] damage to each enemy in the swarm's space (@Check[type:reflex|dc:20|basic:true] save). A creature that critically fails its save is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds} as the ravens focus their attacks on the target's vulnerable face.</p>"
